{"flow": {"nodes": [{"width": 282, "height": 410, "id": "comment-triage", "type": "comment", "position": {"x": -340, "y": 0}, "data": {"text": "1. TRIAGE. 120 real questions from bank customers, each about a card problem. Which of 8 support topics is it? These are easy to confuse (a swallowed card, a lost one, a compromised one...). Three judges pick a topic for each: Jev, GPT-5.4 Mini and Claude Sonnet 5. Open the scorer's Inspect scores > Judges tab to see how often each agrees with the human labels, what each cost, and how fast it was.\n\nData: Banking77 (PolyAI, CC BY 4.0)."}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": -340, "y": 0}}, {"width": 422, "height": 446, "id": "table-bank", "type": "table", "position": {"x": 0, "y": 0}, "data": {"columns": [{"header": "question", "key": "col-0"}, {"header": "topic", "key": "col-1"}], "sel_rows": null, "rows": [{"__uid": "94a9d7c4-0fe6-4b6f-8ce4-27377df153f5", "col-0": "The card I've got seems to be broken.", "col-1": "card_not_working"}, {"__uid": "f3c9299a-119c-420b-8eca-58f58b808cec", "col-0": "What is the payment in my account that I did not do?", "col-1": "card_payment_not_recognised"}, {"__uid": "b0693400-666d-4843-8ef8-a6490183ecc4", "col-0": "If my card is trapped in the ATM, what do I do?", "col-1": "card_swallowed"}, {"__uid": "cc8538c6-a124-4b7f-abf9-a5f394946ad2", "col-0": "I can't use my card.", "col-1": "card_not_working"}, {"__uid": "4314b315-ebbe-4838-af1f-8f8021ab5168", "col-0": "What do I do to stop unauthorized transactions on my card? I was never in the place from which the transactions on my bill were made and I never made them. Please help!", "col-1": "compromised_card"}, {"__uid": "db28d9e1-2540-4814-87c8-f9b61e6be54c", "col-0": "still waiting on my new card", "col-1": "card_arrival"}, {"__uid": "9797c196-2791-4803-b524-cfac204dbc46", "col-0": "My card payment did not work.", "col-1": "declined_card_payment"}, {"__uid": "28d048de-2014-4811-9039-183ce8f4158d", "col-0": "There is a payment that is not mine.", "col-1": "card_payment_not_recognised"}, {"__uid": "fbb8312e-acaf-46b8-89a0-0082f9373365", "col-0": "What happens if the ATM doesn't give me back my card?", "col-1": "card_swallowed"}, {"__uid": "600d01ea-846a-450b-885f-09ec77d235ad", "col-0": "My card doesn't work.", "col-1": "card_not_working"}, {"__uid": "bd55815c-32a0-4c77-bfc0-3c194b1d7b7a", "col-0": "What should I do if I think that someone else may be using my card.", "col-1": "compromised_card"}, {"__uid": "3f5bdd68-b27b-40b8-a189-faa6689a96e3", "col-0": "Why has my card payment been declined?", "col-1": "declined_card_payment"}, {"__uid": "eb2ed6e4-5603-4af1-9102-72f03356da76", "col-0": "Help!  The atm won't give me my card back.", "col-1": "card_swallowed"}, {"__uid": "92f840f0-505f-4d88-8275-90af66d9af03", "col-0": "In my statement there is a payment that is I do not recognize", "col-1": "card_payment_not_recognised"}, {"__uid": "79e6cdc4-cd8c-48a8-8b03-e038f26b89ed", "col-0": "How do I use my new card?", "col-1": "activate_my_card"}, {"__uid": "a4535521-e984-41a4-b957-a7b2e55d7295", "col-0": "I'm still waiting on my card to be delivered.", "col-1": "card_arrival"}, {"__uid": "314cc204-b89f-4770-b793-395ccfcf888e", "col-0": "I see a charge on my account that I don't recall making. I feel like my account may have been compromised.", "col-1": "card_payment_not_recognised"}, {"__uid": "6bfbebde-15e5-4411-b3bb-c7ce11652050", "col-0": "Something is wrong with my payment account since it has been declined", "col-1": "declined_card_payment"}, {"__uid": "43f8b18f-366d-4182-84f5-6e8016ac89fa", "col-0": "Activating my card", "col-1": "activate_my_card"}, {"__uid": "9bbcb6f5-97c3-4187-897f-d59dba71d836", "col-0": "I need help with a lost card", "col-1": "lost_or_stolen_card"}, {"__uid": "25931200-c878-4b7c-9e0f-89ac8dda4a97", "col-0": "Does the card you sent have a way to track to it?", "col-1": "card_arrival"}, {"__uid": "cbecee80-518f-493f-9b0a-7c2ef3e09698", "col-0": "My ATM got stuck and I'm not sure what to do.", "col-1": "card_swallowed"}, {"__uid": "c3f8f138-ecda-456b-ac57-cbcf51176095", "col-0": "I'm starting to think my card is lost because it still hasn't arrived, can you help?", "col-1": "card_arrival"}, {"__uid": "e2f1b4f0-c3d9-40ac-ba4e-bac17cc476cb", "col-0": "How do I activate a new card?", "col-1": "activate_my_card"}, {"__uid": "36b7e386-737b-4775-adc9-5d966bd3cd07", "col-0": "I don't recognize some of the transactions on my card, I think someone must have gotten my card info and used it.", "col-1": "compromised_card"}, {"__uid": "0a8c2d35-886f-444c-a3df-66bf9d78513c", "col-0": "My card declined", "col-1": "declined_card_payment"}, {"__uid": "ca5ff86d-de91-4497-a9dd-ab4792621ace", "col-0": "I was getting cash and can't get my card back.", "col-1": "card_swallowed"}, {"__uid": "c993c67c-a7a6-426b-901d-fefcdedb581e", "col-0": "What is the tracking number for my card that was mailed?", "col-1": "card_arrival"}, {"__uid": "eefe7e40-63bd-465b-97d3-8ce0ed43610c", "col-0": "I was taking out funds and was unable to regain my card.", "col-1": "card_swallowed"}, {"__uid": "3bc78297-a7f9-42c3-80cb-8700ae2286cc", "col-0": "there is a transaction on my account that i didnt make", "col-1": "card_payment_not_recognised"}, {"__uid": "c5adbb78-b941-410a-a9b8-f654c2e977e9", "col-0": "My card stopped working when I use it", "col-1": "card_not_working"}, {"__uid": "39faed98-5565-4b84-ad57-0e827df9c8f5", "col-0": "I don't know where this transaction came from?", "col-1": "card_payment_not_recognised"}, {"__uid": "4373981c-3983-4eeb-b130-a0b4b66fb95c", "col-0": "What is the process of card activation?", "col-1": "activate_my_card"}, {"__uid": "5f157cdf-9244-4bf5-bbd2-dea7a7c60584", "col-0": "I know I didn't make this payment showing up on my card, I don't remember this person at all.", "col-1": "card_payment_not_recognised"}, {"__uid": "fde23f1b-c789-4eca-a6c1-d26fb62b924a", "col-0": "How do I deal with a stolen card?", "col-1": "lost_or_stolen_card"}, {"__uid": "254232f1-1c35-4fdc-bb12-336d2eec4fe7", "col-0": "My card was taken by the ATM.", "col-1": "card_swallowed"}, {"__uid": "a8b71e48-9ec2-4e03-a009-9aaa698acb4c", "col-0": "Oh no!  I lost my card!  Help!", "col-1": "lost_or_stolen_card"}, {"__uid": "3c12fc02-fe70-4730-a39b-4945d26973d6", "col-0": "I think there has been a purchase made that wasn't by me.", "col-1": "card_payment_not_recognised"}, {"__uid": "0fcb8a86-8dbd-453c-af0b-bcfdec6a45d5", "col-0": "If I feel someone has my card information, can I get a new card?", "col-1": "compromised_card"}, {"__uid": "9b059c5e-bf3b-42af-95bf-eb4226d749b1", "col-0": "My card is gone I think it was stolen", "col-1": "lost_or_stolen_card"}, {"__uid": "6799f87e-cf4b-4079-83cf-7b5a9b075067", "col-0": "My actual card isn't working.", "col-1": "card_not_working"}, {"__uid": "542309b6-1e61-4054-bd0b-bcbf92f8e3dd", "col-0": "An unauthorized payment is in my app", "col-1": "card_payment_not_recognised"}, {"__uid": "68949e91-c3eb-4904-9ced-36cc45d6a0a7", "col-0": "Is a copy of the police report necessary for completing the report process?", "col-1": "lost_or_stolen_card"}, {"__uid": "fa1c81e7-378a-4f07-8f51-3f75fa6a775f", "col-0": "It seems someone used my card! There are a few transactions from a small town in the middle of nowhere that I definitely have not made! Please prevent them from using it immediately!", "col-1": "compromised_card"}, {"__uid": "6f5e0c95-fd2e-487f-8ac6-5f6bfd2839f2", "col-0": "I know I have enough funds in my account but my card payment hasn't worked for some reason. What do I do?", "col-1": "declined_card_payment"}, {"__uid": "c36b885f-1c26-4620-99ba-27220af596ca", "col-0": "My card was confiscated by an ATM. How do I get my card back?", "col-1": "card_swallowed"}, {"__uid": "147d5010-61ed-4511-9e83-cf3b40dcec30", "col-0": "I was out today looking forward to pay with my new card, turns out the payment just kept getting declined. This is really sad, what's going on?", "col-1": "declined_card_payment"}, {"__uid": "53dd662b-6699-404a-b54a-ca14d90f95ed", "col-0": "My card is lost! What can I do?", "col-1": "lost_or_stolen_card"}, {"__uid": "70dad011-2ead-4046-9b36-a7833261137a", "col-0": "The ATM at Metro bank on High St. Kensington didn't return my card. What should I do now that the bank is closed?", "col-1": "card_swallowed"}, {"__uid": "51494eb1-b0e7-495d-aaea-9596f32840ab", "col-0": "i want to track the card you sent", "col-1": "card_arrival"}, {"__uid": "36be3693-24b4-4d46-853f-62e16c3c3593", "col-0": "Why was a transaction on my card declined?", "col-1": "declined_card_payment"}, {"__uid": "79e8a5fb-f3e5-4e61-ba73-ac6262455d7b", "col-0": "My card was rejected at the store for some reason, can you look into this for me?", "col-1": "declined_card_payment"}, {"__uid": "666c5e36-54d5-4f78-b41f-8015ac4d94cd", "col-0": "Someone else may be using my card.  There are transactions I don't recognize.", "col-1": "compromised_card"}, {"__uid": "e6f1723b-919e-4983-a4a7-2b307c6d5eeb", "col-0": "I'm really stuck. I don't know why but my card payment has not gone through.", "col-1": "declined_card_payment"}, {"__uid": "cc8045f5-79d2-4f07-befe-756236ac1111", "col-0": "How can I get my card out of the damn ATM?", "col-1": "card_swallowed"}, {"__uid": "bd58a7b5-d280-48cf-b99d-088da69895d6", "col-0": "How do I go about activating my new card?", "col-1": "activate_my_card"}, {"__uid": "aad5b0da-47e2-42d4-918b-d54ee5b63bc0", "col-0": "I ordered my card 2 weeks ago and it still isn't here? What do I do?", "col-1": "card_arrival"}, {"__uid": "43f144fb-5a7c-4e99-aa95-af6e061d8cc5", "col-0": "Please put a freeze on my card,  I am worried there has been some payments on it and I don't know what for.", "col-1": "card_payment_not_recognised"}, {"__uid": "dc9de2f3-7bcb-4f83-b957-512b769f4279", "col-0": "Need help with my card. It's not working.", "col-1": "card_not_working"}, {"__uid": "0aab3007-33fe-4fa9-a76c-92dc9cc51b5d", "col-0": "My card didn't work in one of the shops.", "col-1": "declined_card_payment"}, {"__uid": "eff897df-4060-416d-abe0-38808d7b35fd", "col-0": "My card has not arrived yet.", "col-1": "card_arrival"}, {"__uid": "46eef2f2-3510-4cbf-9e4f-5cbf552f8196", "col-0": "I still have not received my new card, I ordered over a week ago.", "col-1": "card_arrival"}, {"__uid": "874d4269-a854-4cc4-9c83-1414faaea202", "col-0": "Is there a way to know when my card will arrive?", "col-1": "card_arrival"}, {"__uid": "8cfe925e-8d3c-42fe-8b49-bad1bb87561f", "col-0": "What do I do if I think my card was improperly used?", "col-1": "compromised_card"}, {"__uid": "830841d5-3985-49a5-b055-602fc7e455c8", "col-0": "Someone else used my card!", "col-1": "compromised_card"}, {"__uid": "b08c5828-63ed-4249-aebc-7f15cc75cfba", "col-0": "I ordered a card but it has not arrived. Help please!", "col-1": "card_arrival"}, {"__uid": "45aea38b-b205-4323-8cd6-3e45827763b6", "col-0": "My payment has been declined, I thought this issue was fixed!", "col-1": "declined_card_payment"}, {"__uid": "38272ce0-0812-413f-8c4d-bd037c0b11b3", "col-0": "I just got my card and want to use it, how do I activate my card?", "col-1": "activate_my_card"}, {"__uid": "b4cc4305-8367-4061-93eb-bf618e76be2a", "col-0": "Someone I don't know has used my card without permission.", "col-1": "compromised_card"}, {"__uid": "62f9b7f9-b9f7-4765-88c8-e537a67c46c6", "col-0": "I need to activate my card can you do that now?", "col-1": "activate_my_card"}, {"__uid": "55967dad-6655-4517-8cb3-9a4d62e00707", "col-0": "Help!  I can't find my card.", "col-1": "lost_or_stolen_card"}, {"__uid": "c5041348-0740-4481-a29f-de167e6a4330", "col-0": "Do you know if there is a tracking number for the new card you sent me?", "col-1": "card_arrival"}, {"__uid": "0417ce8b-598a-4ef8-a7dc-8bc3143e05c4", "col-0": "I see random purchases to my account, was it hacked?", "col-1": "compromised_card"}, {"__uid": "8dcbdcdd-6deb-4a89-974e-a63f2135cf54", "col-0": "I got my new card. How do I activate it?", "col-1": "activate_my_card"}, {"__uid": "061e4673-0808-4e54-b214-fb02c892b5ae", "col-0": "WTF??? I tried to withdraw some money at a Metro bank on High St. Kensington and without any notice it disappeared in the machine. The bank was already closed so I couldn't do anything. How do I get it back?", "col-1": "card_swallowed"}, {"__uid": "1303ee33-4553-4cbd-a21b-97188095e03c", "col-0": "Can I use app to freeze account and dispute fraud?", "col-1": "compromised_card"}, {"__uid": "87198304-5cb9-4ef6-b739-4fd86416f528", "col-0": "Are you able to locate my card?", "col-1": "lost_or_stolen_card"}, {"__uid": "0a917c32-eaeb-4985-a835-578d4b6e737a", "col-0": "I think someone has access to my card numbers that shouldn't.", "col-1": "compromised_card"}, {"__uid": "13fd3a89-293d-49df-a0c6-a988251442a7", "col-0": "I need help activating my new card.", "col-1": "activate_my_card"}, {"__uid": "d05239b9-ec79-49b0-9765-e9714976aea3", "col-0": "My card won't work.", "col-1": "card_not_working"}, {"__uid": "e4ed5999-b08f-4811-9cd3-a8321e6e863a", "col-0": "I did not get my card yet, is it lost?", "col-1": "card_arrival"}, {"__uid": "b33f6e38-f47d-4857-a813-a06ce3c351c5", "col-0": "What do I need to do to activate my card?", "col-1": "activate_my_card"}, {"__uid": "456ce381-bba8-4684-8488-44632dea4e5a", "col-0": "I was retrieving money and my card wouldn't remove.", "col-1": "card_swallowed"}, {"__uid": "b48c6dfe-6c2f-477c-95a2-1db2abaeb0f8", "col-0": "I think my card is broken", "col-1": "card_not_working"}, {"__uid": "aade7541-efaf-49ef-b290-d9493e61c897", "col-0": "Hello, I am facing the issue with my new card as payments are declining again and again. Please help me in this issue.", "col-1": "declined_card_payment"}, {"__uid": "6cc5cf80-b700-4a58-b948-c5c89d03b132", "col-0": "What should I do if I think someone is using my card.", "col-1": "compromised_card"}, {"__uid": "0a639a12-474f-4297-ae61-81bf2a0bd415", "col-0": "Is it normal to have to wait over a week for my new card?", "col-1": "card_arrival"}, {"__uid": "9f97d919-b2a6-4826-bd3d-64db653ffaa0", "col-0": "Why was my card payment declined?", "col-1": "declined_card_payment"}, {"__uid": "7991cb7e-3dd2-4d6f-a65d-c41c9de534c5", "col-0": "Do you know why my card payment is declined?", "col-1": "declined_card_payment"}, {"__uid": "863a8a27-94f8-4f3b-bbb5-c2cddb5b9fe4", "col-0": "How long will it take to activate my new card?", "col-1": "activate_my_card"}, {"__uid": "9bb12689-0e0d-4870-b0b2-6aa742a87250", "col-0": "I think my statement has a fraudulent charge", "col-1": "card_payment_not_recognised"}, {"__uid": "4c8bf56a-5ea4-4fe9-a6de-8be2d924d66a", "col-0": "Can you please identify the problem with my bank card?", "col-1": "card_not_working"}, {"__uid": "e3eb1e88-2cc7-466d-9aa1-3d7e0aee5a8f", "col-0": "I tried activating my bill of fare and it didn't workplace", "col-1": "activate_my_card"}, {"__uid": "5215ef73-15bc-4a06-a358-e8f27c97ccdf", "col-0": "My card doesn't accept any transaction at all. What's wrong??", "col-1": "card_not_working"}, {"__uid": "13010001-8f45-4067-89fd-60e3f77b173a", "col-0": "Could it be that I deactivated my card, its not working?", "col-1": "card_not_working"}, {"__uid": "e889fa68-b353-4de7-92a3-d2bc898abb72", "col-0": "I cannot find my credit card.", "col-1": "lost_or_stolen_card"}, {"__uid": "60c42d48-4ba3-480b-9112-9b97cafd423a", "col-0": "The new card that was just sent to me was declined multiple times yesterday when I tried to use it at a restaurant to pay for my dinner.  I am really disappointed  and embarrassed that my card was denied when I tried to use it to pay for my friend's birthday dinner.", "col-1": "declined_card_payment"}, {"__uid": "94c10201-f6c5-43ed-92d4-63ebc58d48de", "col-0": "How do I report my card stolen?", "col-1": "lost_or_stolen_card"}, {"__uid": "8d8e7777-0c72-4819-a87d-d264d76517c5", "col-0": "I cant find my card, it's gone.", "col-1": "lost_or_stolen_card"}, {"__uid": "5c844a22-6787-4920-9cae-cab9ecf65430", "col-0": "There is a strange payment on my statement. What should I do?", "col-1": "card_payment_not_recognised"}, {"__uid": "ae26c836-077f-42c7-bbd9-be3438a9f878", "col-0": "I saw a payment i did not do", "col-1": "card_payment_not_recognised"}, {"__uid": "60888889-d9b9-4d40-af78-170bdaaac03f", "col-0": "Tell me how to go about activating my new card?", "col-1": "activate_my_card"}, {"__uid": "af18f248-2793-4c75-bc70-4a831d2ad480", "col-0": "I believe my credit card was stolen.", "col-1": "lost_or_stolen_card"}, {"__uid": "c1eccafc-f1a5-4715-a917-787ab63d688e", "col-0": "Why isn't my card working?", "col-1": "card_not_working"}, {"__uid": "6ee48d40-a8de-477e-9f19-60d5c760a053", "col-0": "The ATM didn't give me the card back!", "col-1": "card_swallowed"}, {"__uid": "d609878f-11f5-4fb7-af2e-90533930121d", "col-0": "Someone has my card number, freeze my account.", "col-1": "compromised_card"}, {"__uid": "77a08700-a3f4-48a1-86c4-a7676bd021d1", "col-0": "My card got stolen!", "col-1": "lost_or_stolen_card"}, {"__uid": "ec8a55ba-df1e-4460-ab4f-1faaf940e5df", "col-0": "Someone stole my wallet earlier today, not sure exactly when, probably on Piccadilly circus. Can you check if there were any attempts to use the card and obviously block it?", "col-1": "lost_or_stolen_card"}, {"__uid": "3254e21d-4968-4f47-9eec-3b46a57365ae", "col-0": "How do I know why my card isn't working?", "col-1": "card_not_working"}, {"__uid": "f5398346-4796-43b6-b90e-d7378fa32ee8", "col-0": "I've been waiting longer than expected for my card.", "col-1": "card_arrival"}, {"__uid": "3d5228c2-816c-4def-bed5-7f71a8662526", "col-0": "Can I use app to freeze my card and dispute fraud?", "col-1": "compromised_card"}, {"__uid": "6cf75362-5da4-4e15-90a8-cd956bc32a29", "col-0": "I need help with activating my card", "col-1": "activate_my_card"}, {"__uid": "2bff23fc-4e67-4fc1-9f0d-992162f7a870", "col-0": "What is the activation process on my new card?", "col-1": "activate_my_card"}, {"__uid": "1fdaaf18-1eab-4f3d-83f7-a00b66083257", "col-0": "How can I freeze a stolen card?", "col-1": "lost_or_stolen_card"}, {"__uid": "ed6f3423-9351-42fb-85bb-63714789e8ae", "col-0": "What do I do since the machine swallowed my card. I need one.", "col-1": "card_swallowed"}, {"__uid": "0ef7b5b9-0a23-4017-af50-c29095ea980d", "col-0": "I'm concerned about a payment that has recently been made on my card.  I do not recognize the name that the transaction went to, can you help me?", "col-1": "card_payment_not_recognised"}, {"__uid": "be20ff79-ebc9-47e2-a7a3-c83ce9ce6613", "col-0": "My card broke.", "col-1": "card_not_working"}, {"__uid": "46fefcb4-abc3-4b16-a83e-5f86b633c092", "col-0": "What do I do if the ATM ate my card?", "col-1": "card_swallowed"}, {"__uid": "4ee6ec39-9e43-4a74-ba55-8e94b7532fae", "col-0": "I did not make this card payment.", "col-1": "card_payment_not_recognised"}, {"__uid": "bf70b50b-a27b-47e5-a6b4-161308d6cc03", "col-0": "I can't get my card to work.", "col-1": "card_not_working"}]}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"width": 325, "height": 496, "id": "llmeval-bank", "type": "llmeval", "position": {"x": 560, "y": 0}, "data": {"title": "Which card topic?", "prompt": "Which of these support topics is the bank customer's message about?", "format": "cat", "categories": "card_arrival: their new card hasn't arrived yet, or they're asking when it will\nactivate_my_card: how to activate a card they've received\ncard_not_working: their card doesn't work, or seems broken\ncard_swallowed: an ATM kept their card\nlost_or_stolen_card: their card is lost or was stolen\ncompromised_card: someone else may have their card details, or used their card\ndeclined_card_payment: a card payment was declined\ncard_payment_not_recognised: there's a card payment on their account they don't recognise", "grader": {"key": "f4ff531a-8c51-4489-a82e-ffe53662882a", "name": "Jev", "emoji": "\u2696\ufe0f", "model": "openrouter/~typesafe/jev-latest", "base_model": "openrouter", "temp": 0, "formData": {"shortname": "Jev", "model": "~typesafe/jev-latest"}, "settings": {}}, "graders": 