nBeforeScoring": false, "judgeStats": [{"judge": "GPT-5.4 Mini", "answers": 120, "priced": 120, "cost_usd": 0.022224750000000012, "input_tokens": 23771, "output_tokens": 977, "median_latency_ms": 965.5}, {"judge": "Claude Sonnet 5", "answers": 120, "priced": 120, "cost_usd": 0.077956, "input_tokens": 33748, "output_tokens": 1046, "median_latency_ms": 1900}, {"judge": "Jev", "answers": 120, "priced": 120, "cost_usd": 0.0024966060000000023, "input_tokens": 59443, "output_tokens": 12272, "median_latency_ms": 364.5}]}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": 560, "y": 0}}, {"width": 282, "height": 518, "id": "comment-scam", "type": "comment", "position": {"x": -340, "y": 620}, "data": {"text": "2. SCAM OR NOT? 100 real text messages: 40 spam or scams (fake prizes, premium-rate numbers to call...) and 60 from friends and family. Three judges flag the scams: Jev, GPT-5.4 Mini and Claude Sonnet 5. The dataset is public, so in case the judges have memorised it, a cheap model lightly paraphrases each message first. Jev also says how sure it is. In the scorer's Judges tab, see how often it's right when it's 90% sure or more: the messages it could filter on its own, leaving only the few it's unsure about for a person.\n\nData: SMS Spam Collection (Almeida and Hidalgo, UCI, CC BY 4.0), a hand-picked sample."}, "positionAbsolute": {"x": -340, "y": 620}}, {"width": 422, "height": 446, "id": "table-scam", "type": "table", "position": {"x": 0, "y": 620}, "data": {"columns": [{"header": "message", "key": "col-0"}, {"header": "scam", "key": "col-1"}], "sel_rows": null, "rows": [{"__uid": "297cbab4-8dc5-4f2a-83fe-d4f11981961c", "col-0": "Oh and by the way you do have more food in your fridge! Want to go out for a meal tonight?", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "f867f263-1f97-4722-8bcf-0edac3435135", "col-0": "Sorry . I will be able to get to you. See you in the morning.", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "da75c0eb-f999-43f4-bd35-ac35222e0bf7", "col-0": "Good morning princess! How are you?", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "6053fbd2-9f33-41bf-afca-fbfe62903316", "col-0": "Understand. his loss is my gain :) so do you work? School?", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "763ec20b-4743-4776-a11b-d5ad5b1d052c", "col-0": "Not yet chikku..wat abt u?", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "beebf47a-2a03-4004-8b55-c2a8d52347cb", "col-0": "Buy Space Invaders 4 a chance 2 win orig Arcade Game console. Press 0 for Games Arcade (std WAP charge) See o2.co.uk/games 4 Terms + settings. No purchase", "col-1": "true"}, {"__uid": "eecfe240-f228-4912-85bb-eef3e3a9628c", "col-0": "Huh? 6 also cannot? Then only how many mistakes?", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "26f83bc5-47cc-4e32-907b-df163e8361a1", "col-0": "I think asking for a gym is the excuse for lazy people. I jog.", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "5cf38b9a-a6aa-4ea1-9a22-c962ab9f6782", "col-0": "URGENT! Your mobile was awarded a \u00a31,500 Bonus Caller Prize on 27/6/03. Our final attempt 2 contact U! Call 08714714011", "col-1": "true"}, {"__uid": "d4c0260c-228a-4c06-a9fc-6bd21a2899c8", "col-0": "No message..no responce..what happend?", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "628f2b6c-1eb7-46dc-ba94-002462c58afb", "col-0": "You've won tkts to the EURO2004 CUP FINAL or \u00a3800 CASH, to collect CALL 09058099801 b4190604, POBOX 7876150ppm", "col-1": "true"}, {"__uid": "17fe5741-9eff-4694-ba57-719fba618949", "col-0": "Oops - am at my mum's in somerset... Bit far! Back tomo, see you soon x", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "5eb51685-e8de-4fb5-9812-b7ccfba0a70e", "col-0": "Thanks for the Vote. Now sing along with the stars with Karaoke on your mobile. For a FREE link just reply with SING now.", "col-1": "true"}, {"__uid": "372658a7-5904-44a1-9339-e46f071a77cb", "col-0": "K..k...from tomorrow onwards started ah?", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "3684e2f1-73c9-49ce-b6b5-1d4655cc4d72", "col-0": "Urgent! Please call 09066612661 from your landline, your complimentary 4* Lux Costa Del Sol holiday or \u00a31000 CASH await collection. ppm 150 SAE T&Cs James 28, EH74RR", "col-1": "true"}, {"__uid": "515cee25-1103-4563-a43b-cda33281a7f3", "col-0": "U don't remember that old commercial?", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "74409240-1d2f-43d7-a370-190c35669ab7", "col-0": "A famous quote : when you develop the ability to listen to 'anything' unconditionally without losing your temper or self confidence, it means you are ......... 'MARRIED'", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "c9400f4e-c74d-42ba-99f7-d0b78d5aaf5d", "col-0": "Want to funk up ur fone with a weekly new tone reply TONES2U 2 this text. www.ringtones.co.uk, the original n best. Tones 3GBP network operator rates apply", "col-1": "true"}, {"__uid": "b0a44163-1602-4cbc-9e44-1eb8f925f9b6", "col-0": ", im .. On the snowboarding trip. I was wondering if your planning to get everyone together befor we go..a meet and greet kind of affair? Cheers,", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "1ab798f0-9b81-496b-a4cc-a4a7f9f72ae5", "col-0": "URGENT! Your Mobile No. was awarded \u00a32000 Bonus Caller Prize on 5/9/03 This is our final try to contact U! Call from Landline 09064019788 BOX42WR29C, 150PPM", "col-1": "true"}, {"__uid": "ae2b952b-370c-46b8-826c-6faef889f7af", "col-0": "Ok... Thanx... Gd nite 2 \u00fc too...", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "73880a18-3bf2-44ab-9259-6da4646c0834", "col-0": "No calls..messages..missed calls", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "76c19f61-7919-4358-998e-1d6e8ec3ab24", "col-0": "As if i wasn't having enough trouble sleeping.", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "84c19465-9c93-40ef-aa57-8bf1af6ed75b", "col-0": "Not a lot has happened here. Feels very quiet. Beth is at her aunts and charlie is working lots. Just me and helen in at the mo. How have you been?", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "18ae28d4-123f-46ce-b5da-152a3700bb54", "col-0": "If he started searching he will get job in few days.he have great potential and talent.", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "9135a59e-1eec-464e-a14c-70417638792f", "col-0": "R u meeting da ge at nite tmr?", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "258bde43-a87a-4c3f-9cd5-e41af80