e new way of walking", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "b6efa7bf-88eb-4931-804f-9a9a48aa46d7", "col-0": "URGENT!! Your 4* Costa Del Sol Holiday or \u00a35000 await collection. Call 09050090044 Now toClaim. SAE, TC s, POBox334, Stockport, SK38xh, Cost\u00a31.50/pm, Max10mins", "col-1": "true"}, {"__uid": "0e326eef-03a0-4086-ad30-8cdd3c2a32bc", "col-0": "No one interested. May be some business plan.", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "c2e8b1d9-da3a-4c29-bf94-82a7c12a032e", "col-0": "A bit of Ur smile is my hppnss, a drop of Ur tear is my sorrow, a part of Ur heart is my life, a heart like mine wil care for U, forevr as my GOODFRIEND", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "08f6119e-1f3f-48db-9228-9638aa8f1a15", "col-0": "Ok i am on the way to railway", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "197bda83-824c-4ec9-a1da-c3854de208b0", "col-0": "Yeah hopefully, if tyler can't do it I could maybe ask around a bit", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "2990a014-cf72-4196-9a62-30776e104fd9", "col-0": "Reminder: You have not downloaded the content you have already paid for. Goto http://doit. mymoby. tv/ to collect your content.", "col-1": "true"}, {"__uid": "67b07db9-0d74-4d61-908e-b7ce546177d6", "col-0": "You won't believe it but it's true. It's Incredible Txts! Reply G now to learn truly amazing things that will blow your mind. From O2FWD only 18p/txt", "col-1": "true"}, {"__uid": "cc5385d9-8ff9-44ef-b46e-09e83d475f1e", "col-0": "Please CALL 08712402779 immediately as there is an urgent message waiting for you", "col-1": "true"}, {"__uid": "b74bd8eb-a84f-4f7a-98b5-6a0892b36140", "col-0": "URGENT! Your Mobile number has been awarded with a \u00a32000 prize GUARANTEED. Call 09061790121 from land line. Claim 3030. Valid 12hrs only 150ppm", "col-1": "true"}, {"__uid": "e586f9fb-1f9e-412c-94f5-f46d085e6779", "col-0": "As a SIM subscriber, you are selected to receive a Bonus! Get it delivered to your door, Txt the word OK to No: 88600 to claim. 150p/msg, EXP. 30Apr", "col-1": "true"}, {"__uid": "426e8ce6-fbbd-4019