s with carly quick now", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "0faf6d94-ae58-4d34-960b-7b283c761e69", "col-0": "Want a new Video Phone? 750 anytime any network mins? Half price line rental free text for 3 months? Reply or call 08000930705 for free delivery", "col-1": "true"}, {"__uid": "d784fb32-ee63-4f79-99e5-629c1447a713", "col-0": "Finish already... Yar they keep saying i mushy... I so embarrassed ok...", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "0c7b379d-83e3-4afb-a1b9-d83972174ed6", "col-0": "Congrats! Nokia 3650 video camera phone is your Call 09066382422 Calls cost 150ppm Ave call 3mins vary from mobiles 16+ Close 300603 post BCM4284 Ldn WC1N3XX", "col-1": "true"}, {"__uid": "8803087f-8520-47e8-b639-ca5e85350045", "col-0": "Todays Vodafone numbers ending with 4882 are selected to a receive a \u00a3350 award. If your number matches call 09064019014 to receive your \u00a3350 award.", "col-1": "true"}, {"__uid": "726a0a9c-cf89-4d1f-ba9f-fe01e1f474e5", "col-0": "Reply to win \u00a3100 weekly! Where will the 2006 FIFA World Cup be held? Send STOP to 87239 to end service", "col-1": "true"}, {"__uid": "b2bdcd76-63a9-4d78-a4a9-ae361152df1d", "col-0": "Todays Voda numbers ending with 7634 are selected to receive a \u00a3350 reward. If you have a match please call 08712300220 quoting claim code 7684 standard rates apply.", "col-1": "true"}, {"__uid": "824e68e7-205f-4d04-ac3b-5b16fa151e87", "col-0": "Studying. But i.ll be free next weekend.", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "ac134d3e-17c0-4679-8178-f72792e8534c", "col-0": "Loans for any purpose even if you have Bad Credit! Tenants Welcome. Call NoWorriesLoans.com on 08717111821", "col-1": "true"}, {"__uid": "c7f6d3ae-1282-457a-b313-3d905e4807ef", "col-0": "\u00dc bot notes oredi... Cos i juz rem i got...", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "c273353c-3639-45ae-a95b-b8744d587463", "col-0": "Ok i also wan 2 watch e 9 pm show...", "col-1": "false"}, {"__uid": "08f00153-4ac5-40a5-bdd1-71f3f6521273", "col-0": "\"URGENT! This is the 2nd attempt to contac